flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to Patient Profile — Diet Plans tab]
    B --> C{Plan exists?}
    C -->|No| D[Show Generate button only]
    D --> Z([End])
    C -->|Yes| E{Authorized?\nAdmin or Doktor}
    E -->|No| F[Read-only view — no edit button]
    F --> Z
    E -->|Yes| G[Click Edit on diet plan card]
    G --> H[Open edit form with existing content]
    H --> I[Modify plan content]
    I --> J[Submit — PATCH /api/patients/id/diet-plans/planId]
    J --> K{Validation passes?}
    K -->|No| L[Show validation errors]
    L --> I
    K -->|Yes| M[DietPlan record updated]
    M --> N[Show updated diet plan card]
    N --> Z
